  {
    "id": 128,
    "time": "2024-10-21T16:25:26.187Z",
    "channel": "STABLE",
    "commits": [
      {
        "sha": "d348cb88a9fe8d19e46102c8b9febe18f746d46b",
        "time": "2024-10-21T16:17:45Z",
        "message": "Restrict BlockProjectileSource#launchProjectile\n\nSpigot recently revamped their CraftBlockProjectileSource impl to make use of\r\nthe the ProjectileItem logic. During this move however, a couple of types were\r\nadded which do not provide a sensible ProjectileItem implementation.\r\n\r\nThe commit restricts the API once again to types that represent useful\r\nProjectileItems, removing support for the trident, enderpearl and breeze variant\r\nof the windcharge."
      }
    ],
    "downloads": {
      "server:default": {
        "name": "paper-1.21.1-128.jar",
        "checksums": {
          "sha256": "4dab63990686350dbf713f9044991f112cebadb64a44865cd79a5a750b820d91"
        },
        "size": 49385295,
        "url": "https://fill-data.papermc.io/v1/objects/4dab63990686350dbf713f9044991f112cebadb64a44865cd79a5a750b820d91/paper-1.21.1-128.jar"
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 127,
    "time": "2024-10-20T23:22:35.747Z",
    "channel": "STABLE",
    "commits": [
      {
        "sha": "14a48cda408dc49db65b345b2e02cd71d9a7aae9",
        "time": "2024-10-20T23:10:10Z",
        "message": "Some small touchups to the GUI (#11505)\n\nAs noted on the issue, the method here can blow up in\r\ncertain cases, the GUI logic already handles \"the mouse is missing\",\r\nand so, we'll just catch this and move on.\r\n\r\nMisc fix - There is probably an issue report for this somewhere,\r\nbut, the details section utilised the bukkit singleton to try to get\r\nthe TPS from the server. We already have the MinecraftServer instance\r\npassed into us, and so we'll just get the information directly from there instead.\r\n\r\nFixes: #11494"
      }
    ],
    "downloads": {
      "server:default": {
        "name": "paper-1.21.1-127.jar",
        "checksums": {
          "sha256": "e857c7bcd5cc9c316b46ba512497a85a21f9494ebb1766b9a98eb49c3011c6e1"
        },
        "size": 49385268,
        "url": "https://fill-data.papermc.io/v1/objects/e857c7bcd5cc9c316b46ba512497a85a21f9494ebb1766b9a98eb49c3011c6e1/paper-1.21.1-127.jar"
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 126,
    "time": "2024-10-20T23:13:23.101Z",
    "channel": "STABLE",
    "commits": [
      {
        "sha": "260c3bbec0fdaf2e25b52cd1cd56533812efb32f",
        "time": "2024-10-20T23:02:00Z",
        "message": "Always send Banner patterns to the client (#11506)\n\nThe mojang client will not remove patterns from a Banner when none\r\nare sent inside of an update packet, given that this is not an expected\r\nflow for them, this is not all too surprising. So, we shall resort to always\r\nsending the patterns over the network for update packets.\r\n\r\nFixes: #11487"
      }
    ],
    "downloads": {
      "server:default": {
        "name": "paper-1.21.1-126.jar",
        "checksums": {
          "sha256": "361574c79c7f824e1767fbdc36bcec97ac770e410326035c5280ecf4e7632821"
        },
        "size": 49384475,
