        "sha": "e3c8a8eef16eb2051b541cabc7419549c3e1e1f6",
        "time": "2024-09-29T21:28:48Z",
        "message": "Add PlayerInsertLecternBookEvent [1.20 port] (#7305)\n\n* Add PlayerInsertLecternBookEvent\r\n\r\n* Rebase\r\n\r\nAdditionally, moves the event call higher up and removes the lectern\r\nblock state clone from the event.\r\n\r\n* jSpecify\r\n\r\n* Shrink correctly\r\n\r\n* style fixups\r\n\r\n* move methods\r\n\r\n* rename param to cancel\r\n\r\n* fix javadocs\r\n\r\n* more javadoc fixes\r\n\r\n* fix co-author on patch from yesterday\r\n\r\n* last fix\r\n\r\n---------\r\n\r\nCo-authored-by: Mariell Hoversholm \u003Cproximyst@proximyst.com\u003E\r\nCo-authored-by: Bjarne Koll \u003Clynxplay101@gmail.com\u003E"
      }
    ],
